===Etymology===
{{multiple images
|direction = vertical
|image1 = Diamondback turtle adult female.jpg
|caption1 = An [[adult#Adjective|adult]] [[female#Adjective|female]] {{vern|diamondback terrapin}} ({{taxlink|Malaclemys terrapin|species|ver=210930}}), one of the [[species]] of [[turtle#Noun|turtles]] originally known as terrapins ''(sense 1)''.
|image2 = Emys orbicularis 2009 G1.jpg
|caption2 = The {{vern|European pond turtle}} or {{vern|European pond terrapin}} ({{taxlink|Emys orbicularis|species|ver=210930}}; ''sense 2'').
|image3 = Red-eared sliders and Mallard in Golden Gate Park 1.jpg
