===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|countable|historical}} Any of several [[small]] [[turtle#Noun|turtles]] [[native#Adjective|native]] to [[North America]] that [[live#Verb|live]] in [[brackish]] or [[fresh#Adjective|fresh]] [[water#Noun|water]], especially the {{vern|diamondback terrapin}} ({{taxlink|Malaclemys terrapin|species|ver=210930}}).
# {{lb|en|countable}} Any of several small turtles of the [[family|families]] [[Emydidae]] and [[Geoemydidae]] found throughout the [[world#Noun|world]].
# {{lb|en|uncountable|historical}} The [[flesh#Noun|flesh]] of such a turtle [[use#Verb|used]] as [[food]].

